  "description": "Preview release targeting .NET 10.\n\n          MySQL/MariaDB is currently not supported in this version due to missing EF Core provider support.\n          If you require MySQL, please use version 9.x.\n          \n          Minimal EfCore.Boost multi-project template with Model and Migrate projects, designed to provide a clean, production-oriented starting point. \n          Includes a simple IpInfo entity, one view, and two routines to demonstrate core patterns.",
